# This repo commits a few binaries on purpose: `./llama-split`, `./stage_pass.so` and `lib/*.so`.
# Together they are what makes a fresh clone pushable to a phone and runnable without building
# anything. `lib/*.so` especially cannot be rebuilt here (it needs a full llama.cpp build in a
# container, ~40 min), so losing it means re-pulling from a working device.
#
# They are still artifacts: `bash build.sh` / `bash build_stage.sh` regenerate the two binaries.
# Rebuild rather than edit, and never let a stale one sit here pretending to be current.

# build leftovers
/llama-split.new
*.o
*.new

# local run artifacts
*.log
*.raw
*.bin
*.out

# python
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# editor leftovers
*~
.*.un~
